### 注册tester（第一次200；重复跑返回400用户名已存在，也是验证点）
POST http://localhost:9001/kb/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "tester", "password": "123456", "nickname": "测试员"}

### admin登录：登录成功后自动把token存进变量adminToken
POST http://localhost:9001/kb/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "admin", "password": "admin123"}

> {%
    client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.data.token);
%}

### tester登录：token存进变量testerToken
POST http://localhost:9001/kb/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "tester", "password": "123456"}

> {%
    client.global.set("testerToken", response.body.data.token);
%}

### 错误密码（应返回400 用户名或密码错误）
POST http://localhost:9001/kb/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "admin", "password": "wrong"}

### 不带token访问（应401）
GET http://localhost:9001/kb/user/me

### 带token查自己（应200，注意返回里没有password字段）
GET http://localhost:9001/kb/user/me
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 管理员接口：admin的token应200
GET http://localhost:9001/kb/user/admin-ping
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 管理员接口：tester的token应403
GET http://localhost:9001/kb/user/admin-ping
Authorization: Bearer {{testerToken}}
### 创建知识库（admin）
POST http://localhost:9001/kb/base
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Java面试题库", "description": "面试突击核心知识点"}

### 创建知识库（tester，MEMBER也能建）
POST http://localhost:9001/kb/base
Authorization: Bearer {{testerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "tester的笔记"}

### 列表（应看到2条）
GET http://localhost:9001/kb/base/list
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### tester删自己的知识库（把2换成tester那条的实际id，应成功）
DELETE http://localhost:9001/kb/base/2
Authorization: Bearer {{testerToken}}

### tester删admin的知识库（应403）
DELETE http://localhost:9001/kb/base/1
Authorization: Bearer {{testerToken}}
### 建根文件夹"Java基础"
POST http://localhost:9001/kb/catalog
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"kbId": 1, "parentId": 0, "title": "Java基础"}

### 建根文件夹"MySQL"
POST http://localhost:9001/kb/catalog
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"kbId": 1, "parentId": 0, "title": "MySQL"}

### 在节点1下建子文件夹（parentId=1）
POST http://localhost:9001/kb/catalog
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"kbId": 1, "parentId": 1, "title": "集合"}

### 看整棵树（应2个根，第一个根下挂1个子节点）
GET http://localhost:9001/kb/catalog/tree/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 改名节点3
PUT http://localhost:9001/kb/catalog/3/rename
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Java集合"}

### 把节点3移到节点2下
PUT http://localhost:9001/kb/catalog/move
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"id": 3, "parentId": 2}

### 成环测试：把节点1移到它自己的子节点3下（应400 不能移入自己的子树）
PUT http://localhost:9001/kb/catalog/move
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"id": 1, "parentId": 3}

### 删空文件夹3（应成功）
DELETE http://localhost:9001/kb/catalog/3
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 删还有子节点的文件夹1（应400 请先删除）——如果3已删光，先再建一个子节点再试
DELETE http://localhost:9001/kb/catalog/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
### 真·成环测试：2是1的祖先，把2塞进1下面（应400）
PUT http://localhost:9001/kb/catalog/move
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"id": 2, "parentId": 1}
### 创建文档（parentId换成一个文件夹的id）
POST http://localhost:9001/kb/doc
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"kbId": 1, "parentId": 1, "title": "HashMap底层原理"}

### 查详情（应看到content={"blocks":[]}、version=0）
GET http://localhost:9001/kb/doc/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 保存内容（version带0）
PUT http://localhost:9001/kb/doc/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "HashMap底层原理", "content": "{\"blocks\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"数组+链表+红黑树\"}}]}", "version": 0}

### 用旧version再存一次（应400 文档已被他人修改）
PUT http://localhost:9001/kb/doc/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"content": "{\"blocks\":[]}", "version": 0}

### 看树（应出现nodeType=DOC的节点）
GET http://localhost:9001/kb/catalog/tree/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 删文档（目录节点应一起消失）
DELETE http://localhost:9001/kb/doc/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
### 上传文件
POST http://localhost:9001/kb/file/upload?kbId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=kb-boundary

--kb-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="notes.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

你好，这是测试文件内容
--kb-boundary--

### 文件列表
GET http://localhost:9001/kb/file/list?kbId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 取预签名URL（id用上传返回的）
GET http://localhost:9001/kb/file/1/url
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 删文件
DELETE http://localhost:9001/kb/file/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ===== 流式端点（SSE）：返回event: delta/done/fallback，观察增量输出 =====

### 面试流式判分：带history验证追问不重复；AI不可用时应收到fallback事件
POST http://localhost:9001/kb/interview/evaluate-stream
Authorization: Bearer {{testerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{"questionId": 1, "answer": "HashMap底层是数组加链表，冲突多了链表转红黑树", "followUsed": 0, "maxFollow": 1, "history": [{"role": "interviewer", "text": "说说HashMap的底层原理"}, {"role": "user", "text": "HashMap底层是数组加链表，冲突多了链表转红黑树"}]}

### 面试流式总评：delta流summary，done带完整报告并落库
POST http://localhost:9001/kb/interview/report-stream
Authorization: Bearer {{testerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{"category": "Java基础", "transcript": "[]", "items": [{"questionId": 1, "stem": "说说HashMap的底层原理", "pass": true, "comment": "答出了核心结构"}]}

### 刷题流式批改（仅简答题，objective题应400）
POST http://localhost:9001/kb/drill/check-stream
Authorization: Bearer {{testerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{"questionId": 1, "answer": "数组加链表，扩容时重新散列"}

### 成长看板：perCategory/recent7/scores三段
GET http://localhost:9001/kb/drill/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{testerToken}}

### 文档问答（SSE）：只依据文档内容回答；AI不可用时done里是固定提示
POST http://localhost:9001/kb/doc/1/ask
Authorization: Bearer {{testerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{"question": "HashMap冲突多了怎么办？", "history": []}

### ===== 简历助手 =====

### 新建空简历
POST http://localhost:9001/kb/resume
Authorization: Bearer {{testerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "测试简历", "targetJob": "Java后端开发"}

### 导入简历（pdf/txt/md，AI提取结构化；AI不可用时aiParsed=false）
POST http://localhost:9001/kb/resume/import
Authorization: Bearer {{testerToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=kb-boundary

--kb-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="resume.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

张三 13800000000 zhangsan@example.com
教育经历：某某大学 本科 计算机 2019-2023
工作经历：某公司 后端开发 2023-至今，负责订单模块，QPS提升30%
--kb-boundary--

### 简历列表（不带正文大字段）
GET http://localhost:9001/kb/resume/list
Authorization: Bearer {{testerToken}}

### 简历详情
GET http://localhost:9001/kb/resume/1
Authorization: Bearer {{testerToken}}

### 保存更新
PUT http://localhost:9001/kb/resume/1
Authorization: Bearer {{testerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "测试简历", "targetJob": "Java后端开发", "contentJson": "{\"basics\":{\"name\":\"张三\",\"phone\":\"13800000000\",\"email\":\"zhangsan@example.com\",\"city\":\"\",\"github\":\"\",\"blog\":\"\"},\"work\":[],\"projects\":[],\"education\":[],\"skills\":[],\"awards\":[]}"}

### 站内素材：刷题科目分布+面试记录
GET http://localhost:9001/kb/resume/materials
Authorization: Bearer {{testerToken}}

### 流式分析（SSE）：delta点评增量→done结构化评审；AI不可用fallback带本地规则清单
POST http://localhost:9001/kb/resume/1/analyze-stream
Authorization: Bearer {{testerToken}}
Accept: text/event-stream

### 流式生成/补全（SSE）：delta是Markdown增量→done带{id,markdown,contentJson}
POST http://localhost:9001/kb/resume/generate-stream
Authorization: Bearer {{testerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{"id": 1, "targetJob": "Java后端开发", "useDrill": true, "useInterview": false, "note": "突出项目深度"}

### 导出Markdown纯文本（非Result包装）
GET http://localhost:9001/kb/resume/1/export.md
Authorization: Bearer {{testerToken}}

### 删简历
DELETE http://localhost:9001/kb/resume/1
Authorization: Bearer {{testerToken}}

### ===== 岗位管理（管理员）=====

### 岗位分页列表：status空=全部，keyword搜岗位名/公司名
GET http://localhost:9001/kb/job/page?page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 只看待审核（爬虫入库默认status=0）
GET http://localhost:9001/kb/job/page?status=0&page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 非管理员访问应403
GET http://localhost:9001/kb/job/page
Authorization: Bearer {{testerToken}}

### 手动录入岗位：source固定MANUAL，status默认0待审核
POST http://localhost:9001/kb/job
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Java开发工程师",
  "company": "测试科技",
  "city": "北京",
  "salary": "15-25K·14薪",
  "experience": "3-5年",
  "education": "本科",
  "skillsJson": "[\"Java\",\"Spring Boot\",\"MySQL\"]",
  "jdText": "1.负责后端服务设计与开发；2.熟悉Spring Boot、MyBatis；3.熟悉MySQL索引与SQL调优；4.有微服务经验优先。"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("jobId", response.body.data.id);
%}

### 岗位详情
GET http://localhost:9001/kb/job/{{jobId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### AI解析JD：结构化需求落require_json（AI未配置应400 AI服务暂不可用）
POST http://localhost:9001/kb/job/{{jobId}}/parse
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### AI推荐面试题：未先解析应400 请先执行AI解析
POST http://localhost:9001/kb/job/{{jobId}}/recommend
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 审核通过（上架 status=1）
POST http://localhost:9001/kb/job/{{jobId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 驳回下架（status=2），可反复上下架
POST http://localhost:9001/kb/job/{{jobId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 编辑岗位
PUT http://localhost:9001/kb/job/{{jobId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Java高级开发工程师",
  "company": "测试科技",
  "city": "北京",
  "salary": "20-30K·14薪",
  "experience": "5-10年",
  "education": "本科",
  "jdText": "负责核心系统设计，带小团队。"
}

### 删岗位
DELETE http://localhost:9001/kb/job/{{jobId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
